 <h3><u>maula zahoor kijiye dil bekarar hai</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p><span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>mere maula</span><br> <span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>maula zahur kijiye dil bekarar hai</span><br> <span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>sadiya guzar chuki hai bhot intezaar hai</span><br> <br> <span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>mere maula 4</span><br> <br> <span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>antar ki karbala me rasad chaye hame</span><br> <span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>ai warise hussain madad chaye hume</span><br> <span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>yeh ruh ki sada hai yeh dil ki pukar hai<br> <br> jo akhri imam k jitna kareeb hai<br> usko zahur utna hi lagta kareeb hai<br> sahil woh saamne hai safina yeh paar hai<br> <br> karni hai kaenat hai ab adl se wasi<br> awaz de raha hai tumhe jannatul baqi<br> bus muntazir imam ka harek mazaar hai<br> <br> ilmo amal ke sath azadar chaye<br> nusrat ke wastey bhi toh kirdar chaye<br> apne amal ka aadmi khud zimmedar hai<br> <br> dunya ki khwahisho se pare bhagte raho<br> nazdik hai zuhure sahar jagte raho<br> nazdik fatema ki chaman ki bahaar hai<br> <br> fathe mubi me legi anaao ki maat se<br> bahar nikal ke aaiye andar ki zaat se<br> aamaal pe faqat hamare in hisaar hai<br> <br> maula ki intezar me hai sari qaenat<br> hum muntazir imam ke hai faqr ki hai baat<br> jisme ke mujtahid hai yeh woh kataar hai<br> <br> ojhal nazar se sher khuda ka woh sher hai<br> parda uthega aankh jhapakne ki der hai<br> bus thodi der aur qamar intezaar hai</span></p> 
